=7.74e-13 cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-03  relerr=7.74e-13  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-04  relerr=1.43e-11  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-05  relerr=5.60e-11  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-06  relerr=1.04e-09  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-07  relerr=1.90e-08  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-08  relerr=1.29e-07  cos=1.000000000000\n[dup-check] lam=1.0 kappa=10 -> best h=1e-03 relerr=2.06e-13 cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-03  relerr=2.06e-13  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-04  relerr=1.83e-12  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-05  relerr=2.30e-11  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-06  relerr=1.73e-10  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-07  relerr=1.78e-09  cos=1.000000000000\n     h=1e-08  relerr=2.76e-08  cos=1.000000000000\n", "output_truncated": false}"}], "is_error": false, "kind": "BenchmarkObservation"}, "action_id": "bb50ca61-64f8-4243-a5e3-7a6fd347e1ec", "extended_content": [], "kind": "ObservationEvent"}
{"id": "66359e31-260d-4a8f-ba25-3c6dd91fee4d", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T10:59:55.850855", "source": "agent", "parent_id": "e755f859-3b2d-4910-8739-6db43bad0edd", "thought": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "Калибровка получилась содержательной (и она же поймала мою собственную ошибку в эталоне). Фиксирую ключевое: ошибка central-FD в fp64 растёт как ε/h (2.1e-13 при h=1e-3 → 2.8e-8 при h=1e-8), «ванна» с минимумом — признак живого оракула, а плоская кривая по `h` = сломанный эталон. Отдаю финальный протокол."}], "reasoning_content": "Excellent. Now I have a clean calibration:
- FD (central) error scales as h² in the truncation regime and ~1/h in roundoff regime; optimum near h≈1e-3..1e-4 for this quadratic-over-linear composite (it's exactly quadratic in φ, so truncation error is essentially zero for a quadratic loss → central difference is exact for quadratics! Indeed the meta-loss here is quadratic in φ, so central FD has zero truncation error; the observed scaling is purely roundoff amplification ~ε/h²... let's see: at h=1e-3 → 2e-13, h=1e-8 → 2.8e-8; ratio per decade ≈ 100× per 10× decrease → error ~ ε/h with ε~2e-16: at h=1e-8, 2e-16/1e-8=2e-8 ✓. Yes, error ≈ eps/h → consistent with cancellation of loss values.

